      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "jisui-post-10",
      "floor": 10,
      "authorId": "buxin",
      "timestamp": "2016-08-15T08:54:00+08:00",
      "content": [
        "人病好了就是法子灵，人没了就是日子算错了。",
        "那这东西岂不是怎么说都有理？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "jisui-post-11",
      "floor": 11,
      "authorId": "zhishang",
